Design a reusable internal page template.

Header:
Large category title.

Example:

“FLUID
MECHANICS
LAB”

Hero image showing laboratory apparatus.

Below:

ABOUT THE LAB

KEY EXPERIMENTS

EQUIPMENT

TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS

APPLICATIONS

DOWNLOAD CATALOGUE

REQUEST ENQUIRY

Create product/equipment cards below.

Each product should include:
Product image
Product name
Model number
Short description
Key specifications
VIEW DETAILS


9. ENGINEERING EQUIPMENT SHOWCASE

Create a visually rich section showing individual apparatus.

Use large product photography against clean white/light grey backgrounds.

Examples:

Venturimeter
Bernoulli's Apparatus
Reynolds Apparatus
Heat Exchanger
Fourier's Law Apparatus
Steam Turbine Model
IC Engine Test Rig
Automobile Cut Section Model
Universal Testing Machine
Beam Deflection Apparatus

Make the equipment look premium and technically accurate.

Avoid generic stock imagery wherever possible.


10. CTA SECTION

Create a bold final section:

“BUILD A
BETTER LAB.”

Supporting text:

“Explore laboratory equipment and engineering solutions designed for practical learning.”

Buttons:

VIEW PRODUCTS
REQUEST ENQUIRY

Use a large product/laboratory visual in the background.


